{"id":"word:hebrew:H8328","type":"word","title":"שֶׁרֶשׁ","subtitle":"H8328 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a root (literally or figuratively)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שֶׁרֶשׁ (H8328) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 33 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שֶׁרֶשׁ (sheresh) means a root (literally or figuratively) First listed occurrence: 2Kgs 19 30."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שֶׁרֶשׁ","transliteration":"sheresh","pronunciation":"sheh'-resh","strong":"H8328","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8328","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["שֹׁ֣רֶשׁ","וְ/שָׁרָשָׁ֖י/ו","שָׁרְשָׁ/ם֙","שָֽׁרָשָׁ֣י/ו","וְ/שֹׁ֥רֶשׁ"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",4],["HNcmpc/Sp3fs",4],["HNcmpc/Sp3ms",4],["HC/Ncmsc",4],["HNcmsc/Sp3mp",3],["HC/Ncmpc/Sp3ms",2],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",2],["HR/Ncmpc/Sp3fs",1],["HR/Ncmpc/Sp3ms",1],["HNcmsc",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a root (literally or figuratively)","usage":"bottom, deep, heel, root.","full":"H8328. shoresh שֹׁ֫רֶשׁ noun masculine Deut 29:17 root ; — ׳שׁ absolute 29:17 +, construct Isa 11:10 +; suffix שָׁרְשִׁי Job 29:19 , etc.; plural construct שָׁרְשֵׁי 13:27 (see below) Job 36: suffix שָֽׁרָשָׁיו Amos 2:9 +, שָֽׁרָשֶׁיהָ Ezek 17:7 +; — 1 root of people under figure of tree, involving firmness, permanence, Amos 2:9 ; Hosea 9:16 ; 14:6 ; Isa 14:30 ; 2Kin 19:30 = Isa 37:31 ; &#8212; שָׁרְשָׁם Judg 5:14 is probably corrupt, see GFM; — so of person (compare Phoenician, Eshmunazar 11 GACooke pp. 30, 36 ) Isa 5:24 ; Malachi 3:19; Job 8:17 ; 18:16 ; 29:19 ; Prov 12:3 , 12 ; = stock, family Isa 11:1 , 10 ; Dan 11:7 , compare (of serpent) Isa 14:29 ; = source or cause Deut 29:17 , ׳שׁ דָּבָר Job 19:28 . 2 literally root of tree or shrub Jer 17:8 (simile), Ezek 31:7 (metaphor of people). Isa 53:2 (simile), Job 14:8 ; 30:4 ; of vine (metaphor of people) Ezek 17:6-7 , 9 (twice in verse); Psa 80:10 (accusative of congnate meaning with verb with שׁרשׁ Hiph`il ). 3 root , figurative=lowest stratum, of mountain Job 28:9 , of sea 36:30 = bottom (text strange and dubious: Du הָרִים רָאשֵׁי , with אֵרוֺ in v a ); of feet, רַגְלַי שָׁרְשֵׁי 13:27 , i.e. soles Ew Di De Da and others (elsewhere כַּף ), Bu place of treading, footholds ; Du (arbitrarily) שָׁרְשִׁי , strike out רגלי . [ שֹׁ֫רֶשׁ ] noun masculine Dan 4:12 root (see Biblical Hebrew); — plural suffix שָׁרְשׁוֺ֫הִי of tree 4:12 ; 4:20 ; 4:23 .","rootNote":"from 8327 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Kgs 19 30","keyReferences":["2Kgs 19 30","Amos 2 9","Dan 11 7","Deut 29 17","Ezek 17 6","Ezek 17 7","Ezek 17 9","Ezek 17 9"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":33,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Kgs 19 30","book":"2Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֹׁ֣רֶשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Amos 2 9","book":"Amos","chapter":2,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שָׁרָשָׁ֖י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Dan 11 7","book":"Dan","chapter":11,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שָׁרָשֶׁ֖י/הָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Deut 29 17","book":"Deut","chapter":29,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֹׁ֛רֶשׁ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 17 6","book":"Ezek","chapter":17,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שָׁרָשָׁ֖י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Ezek 17 7","book":"Ezek","chapter":17,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שָׁרֳשֶׁ֣י/הָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Ezek 17 9","book":"Ezek","chapter":17,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שָׁרָשֶׁ֨י/הָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Ezek 17 9","book":"Ezek","chapter":17,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/שָּׁרָשֶֽׁי/הָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpc/Sp